All contents that are exclusive to the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]], could be Cat/Enemy units, stages or features that do not appear in any other version.<br>
Despite a majority of features that are in the Japanese Version, they may also appear in the Taiwanese or Korean version. Example: [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon Collaboration]].<br>
Japanese content can be recognised by using the template {{[[Template:JPExclusive]]}}.